  "description": "Identifies markets at high risk of imminent shutdown or disruption",
  "definition": "A market with MVI > 75, MSI < 40, and at least one 'Critical' security alert (alertsev = 'Critical'). These markets typically show signs of administrative instability, declining transaction volumes, and may suggest potential exit scam preparation or law enforcement attention."
}
